      "id": "claim_e05327a6962e422c8d7d20080498b784",
      "statement": "FeedFetcher.fetch calls FeedUrlValidator.validate(url) before every HTTP request (unconditional subscribe-time fetch, conditional poll-time fetch, and the reader-view fetch), rejecting non-http/https schemes and hosts resolving to loopback, link-local, RFC1918 site-local, any-local, multicast, fc00::/7 unique-local IPv6, or 100.64.0.0/10 CGNAT addresses, throwing IllegalArgumentException (mapped to HTTP 400).",
