      "id": "claim_ed39a527fc0f41729498bd705de675ab",
      "statement": "ArticleExtractionService.extract first checks the article.extracted_content cache via ArticleRepository.findExtractedContent; on a hit it returns cached content without any network fetch, and on a miss it fetches article.url through FeedFetcher (reusing the SSRF guard, size cap, and User-Agent), decodes with jsoup (header Content-Type charset else BOM/meta sniffing), runs Readability4J.parse(), persists the result via ArticleRepository.saveExtractedContent, and returns an ExtractedContent(title, contentHtml) record.",
